abstract: "The untagged-prose extraction layer of a multi-repo SEC Filing Intelligence Platform: a dual-track (XBRL-precedence + heuristic + LLM) system for extracting structured financial data from the narrative sections of SEC 10-K/10-Q/8-K filings, using a QLoRA fine-tuned Llama 3.1 8B model with NF4 4-bit quantization. Schema conformance is 100% (6/6) across 1 synthetic and 5 real EDGAR filings; model loading and inference are validated on a 16GB single-GPU instance (Tesla T4). Extraction-accuracy and latency figures reported elsewhere for this project are unverified targets pending a trained adapter, not measured results — see the Evidence and Benchmarks section of the repository README for the current evidence status."
